  "feature": null,
  "description": "The id-017 descriptor plus an `issuer` member. RFC-AITP-0002 §1: `issuer` MUST be absent for `pinned_key`, whose trust anchor is the local `pinned_keys` store, not an issuer. The identity schema's non-`oidc` branch forbids it, so the descriptor is schema-invalid. The proof is valid and the sender is in `trust_store`, so the `issuer` member is the only reason to fail. Receiver MUST reject with IDENTITY_FAILED.",
  "tags": [
    "security",
    "identity",
    "pinned_key",
    "issuer"
  ],
